    "created_at": "2025-10-02T13:14:18Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-10-02T13:14:18Z",
    "body": "I was trying to determine if in the future we might want this for any of the other consumption methods, but it seems unlikely, although I suppose there is talk of streaming JSON every now and then.\n\nAgreed with @lukewarlow on `Blob`. I don't think this addition makes sense for `PushMessageData`, which wasn't mentioned thus far, especially given the push for Declarative Web Push which is purely JSON based.\n\nI'd love to know what @bakkot makes of this.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
