    "body": "> I was trying to determine if in the future we might want this for any of the other consumption methods\n\nI had the same question, The only thing I could see is a `blobStream()` that just turns each `Uint8Array` chunk into a `Blob` chunk, but that doesn't seem useful at all. Streaming JSON would quite handy, but would require a whole parsing spec, it's definitely not a \"convenience method\".",
