    "created_at": "2025-10-02T15:23:02Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-10-02T15:23:02Z",
    "body": "It would require a bit more code if they wanted to account for arbitrary `Content-Type` and the like. It also doesn't seem unreasonable to see if existing content is working around this or if libraries are; that would be necessary before we invest in a non-UTF-8-compatible solution in my opinion. (Which indeed can come later as we'd want to share it with `text()` anyway.)",
